{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>\n{\n  \"plan\": \"大字沿“离开后松口气—舍不得与受气反复拉扯—想念中的孤单—回不回去的犹豫—先过稳眼下—带着想念继续生活”接力；小字把每颗珠子的声响、身体感、画面与不同听法拆开，同珠相邻，按段落转折散放。开头的“站不稳、悬着”在回望时再现，后段变成“脚已迈开、终于踩实”；“亲近、受气、想念”反复出现，但每次都随他的处境改变。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他离开熟悉的日子，终于不用再受委屈。\",\"keys\":[\"离开\",\"不用再受委屈\"],\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S01-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"沉甸甸\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"硬挺着背\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不能倒下\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心里却打晃\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"没了方向\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"使不上劲\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"真想停下来\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"像要宣布什么\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"1–6\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像烟往上散\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"1–6\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越来越轻\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"1–6\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越来越远\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"1–6\"},\n          {\"text\":\"悬在半空\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"1–6\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像在召唤\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"1–6\"},\n          {\"text\":\"静静等回声\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"1–6\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"没多久，他心里空落落的，不知舍不得什么。\",\"keys\":[\"空落落\",\"舍不得\"],\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S01-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"轻轻一叹\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"话刚开头\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"突然没声\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"长长的停顿\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"余音慢慢散\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"冷冰冰的\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"有气没处撒\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像是有遗憾\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又像在怀念\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"刚醒时的迷糊\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"四周冷清\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"胸口发紧\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"眼前模糊\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"手有些抖\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"伸手摸个空\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还没哭出来\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不知身在何处\",\"bead\":\"S01-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他还想往前过，却不知道以后怎么安心。\",\"keys\":[\"往前过\",\"怎么安心\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S01-3\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"旧画面闪回\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"9–17\"},\n          {\"text\":\"那时的声音\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"9–17\"},\n          {\"text\":\"那时的光线\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"9–17\"},\n          {\"text\":\"熟悉的感觉\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"9–17\"},\n          {\"text\":\"却回不到当时\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"9–17\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脚先记起来\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"18–23\"},\n          {\"text\":\"试着迈步\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"18–23\"},\n          {\"text\":\"被带着往前\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"18–23\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还没站稳\",\"bead\":\"S01-B5\",\"bars\":\"18–23\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他舍不得过去的自在，一想到回不去就心慌。\",\"keys\":[\"舍不得\",\"心慌\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S02-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"步子清楚了\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不像凯旋\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"远处传来旧歌\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"依稀还记得\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"只能哼几句\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"众人面前庄严\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"自己低声哼唱\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"珍惜的东西\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不再是自己的\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"不像士兵走路\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"腿脚发虚\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"挪着舞步\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"架子挺得高\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"旋律却脆弱\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"有点凄凉\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"底下细细蠕动\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"暗暗不安\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他赶紧想起受过的气，怕心软得忘了为何离开。\",\"keys\":[\"受过的气\",\"怕心软\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S02-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"猛地往上冲\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"38–43\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又退回来\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"38–43\"},\n          {\"text\":\"重新攒力气\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"44–65\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越来越焦灼\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"52–63\"},\n          {\"text\":\"呼吸被催快\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"56–65\"},\n          {\"text\":\"到头还落不稳\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"44–65\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"整理好衣服\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"抬起头\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不让人看出动摇\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"我没事\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"44–65\"},\n          {\"text\":\"起初还信几分\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"44–65\"},\n          {\"text\":\"后来拼命说服自己\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"44–65\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越说越露馅\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"44–65\"},\n          {\"text\":\"其实很在意\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"44–65\"},\n          {\"text\":\"难过还在\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"可他不甘心，难道离开，就得把好日子也丢了？\",\"keys\":[\"不甘心\",\"好日子\"],\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S02-3\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"不能就这么结束\",\"bead\":\"S02-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"咬牙抵抗\",\"bead\":\"S02-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"自信没那么足\",\"bead\":\"S02-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他还憋着气，却想起曾有人把他当自己人。\",\"keys\":[\"憋着气\",\"自己人\"],\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S03-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"像挨了重重一锤\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"66\"},\n          {\"text\":\"火气上来了\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不肯服气\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"忽强忽弱\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心里一悬\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"步子不再端正\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"转来转去\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"想往前走\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"找不准方向\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"急得发慌\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"66–79\"},\n          {\"text\":\"坐不住\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"66–79\"},\n          {\"text\":\"忽然柔和\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"轻轻松松\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"夏天的麦浪\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一阵微风\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不必提防\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"相处得亲近\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心头一颤\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"亲切得刺痛\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"},\n          {\"text\":\"隔得太远\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"80–91\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"高兴才一会儿，他又心酸：离开就一定更好吗？\",\"keys\":[\"高兴\",\"心酸\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S03-1\",\"S03-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"耳边窃窃私语\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"你一句我一句\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"绕来绕去\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"找不到出口\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脚下像流沙\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"抓不住重心\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"四处漂着\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"暂时躲开\",\"bead\":\"S03-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"聊点别的\",\"bead\":\"S03-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"出去走走\",\"bead\":\"S03-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"先不碰伤口\",\"bead\":\"S03-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"真松快了一会儿\",\"bead\":\"S03-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"难题还在\",\"bead\":\"S03-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"那股劲退了\",\"bead\":\"S03-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"渐渐安静\",\"bead\":\"S03-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"若有所思\",\"bead\":\"S03-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"刚才真信了吗？\",\"bead\":\"S03-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还是在说服自己？\",\"bead\":\"S03-B5\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"想起那些亲近时候，他真盼能像从前一样。\",\"keys\":[\"亲近\",\"像从前一样\"],\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S04-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"声音更柔\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像独自说话\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"旧事又鲜活\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心存感激\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"满心柔情\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"短短的幸福\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一碰就疼\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脚还往前走\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心里有回声\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"想让自己坚定\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"一下像风暴\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"108–115\"},\n          {\"text\":\"绷得紧紧的\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"108–115\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越用力越晃\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"108–115\"},\n          {\"text\":\"好得让人疼\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"108–115\"},\n          {\"text\":\"再也回不去\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"108–115\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一步步退后\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"108–115\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又累又急\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"108–115\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"可他又怀疑当初走错了，却想不出不走会怎样。\",\"keys\":[\"怀疑\",\"想不出\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S04-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"脚步急匆匆\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心跳乱了拍\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"低处紧紧追\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"右手乱挣扎\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像被时间催\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"根本停不住\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"要是当时……\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"是不是还有办法\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"怎么变成这样\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脑子停不了\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"却没到哪儿\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不敢停下来\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"反复打转\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他仍觉得那些气不该忍，却也舍不得快乐回忆。\",\"keys\":[\"不该忍\",\"快乐回忆\"],\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S05-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"像换个人开口\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"116\"},\n          {\"text\":\"轻声细语\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"离得更近\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"话还收着\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"夜里两个影子\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"温柔里带劲\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"116–127\"},\n          {\"text\":\"被推着往前\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"116–127\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不能就这么算\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"116–127\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心里还有火\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"116–127\"},\n          {\"text\":\"难过也在\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"116–127\"},\n          {\"text\":\"想护住自己\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"116–127\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"旧事有了温度\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像在想某个人\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"也像想故乡\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"从前的生活\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又有点失落\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"跟自己争到没力气，他只觉得离开那些人很难受。\",\"keys\":[\"没力气\",\"很难受\"],\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S05-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"一直往前流\",\"bead\":\"S05-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"渐渐放缓\",\"bead\":\"S05-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"声音越来越稀\",\"bead\":\"S05-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"只剩一个声音\",\"bead\":\"S05-B4\",\"bars\":\"128–129、139–144\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脚下地板没了\",\"bead\":\"S05-B4\",\"bars\":\"128–129、139–144\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"越来越坐不住\",\"bead\":\"S05-B5\",\"bars\":\"约132–147\"},\n          {\"text\":\"几次深呼吸\",\"bead\":\"S05-B5\",\"bars\":\"144–147\"},\n          {\"text\":\"长长一叹\",\"bead\":\"S05-B5\",\"bars\":\"144–147\"},\n          {\"text\":\"终于松一点\",\"bead\":\"S05-B5\",\"bars\":\"144–147\"},\n          {\"text\":\"其实没想通\",\"bead\":\"S05-B5\",\"bars\":\"144–147\"},\n          {\"text\":\"抵抗得累了\",\"bead\":\"S05-B5\",\"bars\":\"144–147\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"难受缓下来，他没再拿受过的气压住想念。\",\"keys\":[\"缓下来\",\"想念\"],\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S06-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"突然安静了\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"148\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像换个世界\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"声音拖得长\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"慢慢悠悠\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像是停住了\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"隔着透明玻璃\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"外面都远了\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"连呼吸都放轻\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"耳边的摇篮曲\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"妈妈轻轻哼\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"温柔得很\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"终于松了戒备\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"安心一小会儿\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"日子并没变好\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"没法永远待着\",\"bead\":\"S06-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"难事常得自己扛，他才知道有人陪着多轻松。\",\"keys\":[\"自己扛\",\"有人陪着\"],\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S06-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"像轻轻祈祷\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"庄严又安静\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"藏在心里的话\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不用再解释\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不用装坚强\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"压着的委屈\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"想念冒出来\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"压住的愿望\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"对着远方祈求\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不知向谁说\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不知有没有回音\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"远处亮起来\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"约160\"},\n          {\"text\":\"梦里的家园\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"约160\"},\n          {\"text\":\"隔得好远\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"约160\"},\n          {\"text\":\"明明看得见\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"约160\"},\n          {\"text\":\"却回不去\",\"bead\":\"S06-B2\",\"bars\":\"约160\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他怕再没有那种亲近，好在自己真的有过。\",\"keys\":[\"怕再没有\",\"真的有过\"],\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S06-3\",\"S06-4\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"小心试探\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"148–151\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不敢一下说尽\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"148–151\"},\n          {\"text\":\"慢慢敞开\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"152–167\"},\n          {\"text\":\"鼓起勇气\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"152–167\"},\n          {\"text\":\"藏着的话出口了\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"152–167\"},\n          {\"text\":\"再往深处说\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"168–180\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心里越来越满\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"168–180\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越说越迫切\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"168–180\"},\n          {\"text\":\"话还没说完\",\"bead\":\"S06-B3\",\"bars\":\"约180\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"明知挽不回\",\"bead\":\"S06-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不急着去抓\",\"bead\":\"S06-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"把声音放轻\",\"bead\":\"S06-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"眼前珍惜的东西\",\"bead\":\"S06-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"只想好好看看\",\"bead\":\"S06-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不必立刻要回来\",\"bead\":\"S06-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"刚安心一点，他又怕往后遇事只能独自撑着。\",\"keys\":[\"刚安心\",\"独自撑着\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S07-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"高处轻轻发颤\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"细得像丝线\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"冷得刺骨\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"寒风扑进来\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"窗子被吹开\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"美梦一下断了\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"后颈一凉\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脉搏猛地跳\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"},\n          {\"text\":\"整个人惊醒\",\"bead\":\"S07-B1\",\"bars\":\"182附近\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"舞步突然闯进\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"刚才还像祈祷\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"场景一下换了\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"话头被截断\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"从别处说起\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"舞步很鲜明\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"却不是好转\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心还没安定\",\"bead\":\"S07-B2\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"旧时那股昂扬\",\"bead\":\"S07-B5\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又浮出来\",\"bead\":\"S07-B5\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"模样不再完整\",\"bead\":\"S07-B5\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"},\n          {\"text\":\"站不回原来的稳\",\"bead\":\"S07-B5\",\"bars\":\"182–197\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"当初只想不再受气，他没料到离开会这么孤单。\",\"keys\":[\"不再受气\",\"这么孤单\"],\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S07-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"熟悉的小动作\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"曾经的舞步\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"平常的旧日子\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一下闯进来\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"明明很亲切\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"却没有安慰\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"熟悉得心疼\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"失去的更清楚\",\"bead\":\"S07-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"一阵接一阵\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越绷越紧\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"念头翻来覆去\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"停不下来\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像是已经过去\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"身体却不信\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心里还打颤\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"想要冲出去\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"找不到出口\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"},\n          {\"text\":\"久久静不下来\",\"bead\":\"S07-B3\",\"bars\":\"198–205\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他想找回亲近，又怕回去受气，连决心也没了。\",\"keys\":[\"想找回亲近\",\"决心也没了\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S07-3\"]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他先不管回不回去，想起从前的亲近又暖了心。\",\"keys\":[\"回不回去\",\"暖了心\"],\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S08-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"慢慢的歌声\",\"bead\":\"S08-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"宽宽的声响\",\"bead\":\"S08-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又想起心事\",\"bead\":\"S08-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像轻轻祈求\",\"bead\":\"S08-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"心里软下来\",\"bead\":\"S08-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"柔软处又打开\",\"bead\":\"S08-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"脑子正乱\",\"bead\":\"S08-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"忽然能喘气\",\"bead\":\"S08-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"胸口吸进一口气\",\"bead\":\"S08-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"紧绷稍微松开\",\"bead\":\"S08-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"只有一小会儿\",\"bead\":\"S08-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还不算安稳\",\"bead\":\"S08-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"可暖意转眼就淡了，回忆也没法替他扛难事。\",\"keys\":[\"暖意转眼就淡了\",\"扛难事\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S08-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"刚刚认出来\",\"bead\":\"S08-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还没安顿好\",\"bead\":\"S08-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又退去了\",\"bead\":\"S08-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"临走回头\",\"bead\":\"S08-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"再看一眼\",\"bead\":\"S08-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"那一下温柔\",\"bead\":\"S08-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"舍不得离开\",\"bead\":\"S08-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他想回去，是舍不得从前，还是难过时想有人陪？\",\"keys\":[\"舍不得从前\",\"有人陪\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S09-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"两手铺开\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"206–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"颤动的光晕\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"206–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"冷冷闪回来\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"郑重劲没了\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"刚刚落稳\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又往高处飘\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"那点稳又散了\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还是那扇门\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"从另一面看\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脚步没聚拢\",\"bead\":\"S09-B1\",\"bars\":\"214–215\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"这念头吓得他不敢再往下想。\",\"keys\":[\"吓得\",\"不敢再往下想\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S09-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"从前的自己\",\"bead\":\"S09-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又不知道怎么办\",\"bead\":\"S09-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"已经走过这么多\",\"bead\":\"S09-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"旧问题又来了\",\"bead\":\"S09-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"仍没有答案\",\"bead\":\"S09-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他最舍不得的，是从前有人把他当自己人。\",\"keys\":[\"最舍不得\",\"自己人\"],\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S10-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"试探着开口\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"断断续续\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"几块旧碎片\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"轻得发虚\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像从前的歌\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又像舞步残影\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"摇篮曲也碎了\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"变得凄凄的\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"怎么也连不成\",\"bead\":\"S10-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"脚下猛一空\",\"bead\":\"S10-B2\",\"bars\":\"221–225\"},\n          {\"text\":\"整个人飘起来\",\"bead\":\"S10-B2\",\"bars\":\"221–225\"},\n          {\"text\":\"悬在半空\",\"bead\":\"S10-B2\",\"bars\":\"221–225\"},\n          {\"text\":\"认不清方向\",\"bead\":\"S10-B2\",\"bars\":\"221–225\"},\n          {\"text\":\"零零碎碎\",\"bead\":\"S10-B2\",\"bars\":\"221–225\"},\n          {\"text\":\"忽近忽远\",\"bead\":\"S10-B2\",\"bars\":\"221–225\"},\n          {\"text\":\"没处落脚\",\"bead\":\"S10-B2\",\"bars\":\"221–225\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"可回去未必如从前，那些委屈也不能当没发生。\",\"keys\":[\"未必如从前\",\"不能当没发生\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S10-1\",\"S10-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"问题又递回来\",\"bead\":\"S10-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"以后怎么过？\",\"bead\":\"S10-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"起初的犹豫\",\"bead\":\"S10-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"经历了这么多\",\"bead\":\"S10-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还是没想通\",\"bead\":\"S10-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"疲惫得很\",\"bead\":\"S10-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"反复想了很久，他仍没答案，日子也过不踏实。\",\"keys\":[\"没答案\",\"不踏实\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S10-3\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"累得不想说\",\"bead\":\"S10-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"明明很重要\",\"bead\":\"S10-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又想起旧事\",\"bead\":\"S10-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"没有力气再讲\",\"bead\":\"S10-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"想说又说不出\",\"bead\":\"S10-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"只剩疲倦\",\"bead\":\"S10-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"明知回去未必找回亲近，他还是忍不住心动。\",\"keys\":[\"未必找回\",\"心动\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S11-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"低音滚滚涌来\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226\"},\n          {\"text\":\"像大浪拍来\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一下下重砸\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一次次炸开\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还是没松口气\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"又有新的重压\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"困兽似的挣扎\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不是凯旋\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"跑也跑不顺\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–237\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一步一顶\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–241\"},\n          {\"text\":\"再咬牙使劲\",\"bead\":\"S11-B1\",\"bars\":\"226–241\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"但他不想再受委屈，决定先把眼下的日子过稳。\",\"keys\":[\"不想再受委屈\",\"过稳\"],\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S11-2\",\"S11-3\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"步子还没齐\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"前面有没有路？\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"226–229\"},\n          {\"text\":\"伸脚试一试\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"226–229\"},\n          {\"text\":\"慢慢聚成舞步\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"一步步往前\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越走越躲不开\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"238–241\"},\n          {\"text\":\"越攒越高\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"238–241\"},\n          {\"text\":\"轻声歌也迈步\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"低声祈祷\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"变成往前的劲\",\"bead\":\"S11-B2\",\"bars\":\"238–241\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"即使怕往后独自撑着，他也不肯收回这个打算。\",\"keys\":[\"怕\",\"不肯收回\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S11-4\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"心里还害怕\",\"bead\":\"S11-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"脚已经迈开\",\"bead\":\"S11-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"紧绷没消失\",\"bead\":\"S11-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"有点奇怪的轻松\",\"bead\":\"S11-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不再原地停着\",\"bead\":\"S11-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"问题并没解决\",\"bead\":\"S11-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"却能继续往前\",\"bead\":\"S11-B3\",\"bars\":\"238–241\"}\n        ]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"受过的委屈和那些开心的日子，他都愿意记着。\",\"keys\":[\"委屈\",\"开心的日子\"],\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S12-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\":\"还是会犹豫\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"还会觉得累\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"依然会想念\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"明明受过伤\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"不装没事\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"自己选怎么站\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"伤还在\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},\n          {\"text\":\"人也能站直\",\"bead\":\"S12-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}\n        ]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他还是怕孤单，却不肯为有人陪就回头受气。\",\"keys\":[\"怕孤单\",\"不肯\"],\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S12-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[\n          {\"text\"